Delegate_ShareClass_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the delegator is the Safe
│   └── it should revert with SafeCannotVote
├── when the delegatee is the Safe
│   ├── given it is delegate
│   │   └── it should revert with SafeCannotVote
│   └── given it is delegateBySig
│       └── it should revert with SafeCannotVote
└── when neither is the Safe
    ├── it should move the delegator's votes to the delegatee
    └── it should emit DelegateChanged
